      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering Cloud Providers**\n\nI'm currently focused on identifying a suitable external provider for streaming audio chunks in `stream_chunks.py`. A cloud provider with a Speech-to-Text or Text-to-Speech API seems like the most logical choice for this task. I need to ensure the provider is clearly identifiable within the code.\n\n\n**Defining `stream_chunks.py`**\n\nI'm now writing the content of `stream_chunks.py`, focusing on using Google Cloud Speech-to-Text for streaming audio chunks. I'll include imports and client initialization to make the provider clear. The goal is to provide a working example demonstrating the streaming process, which will facilitate its implementation later.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789867278470,
          "start": 1789867275756
